---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Ansley Travo — Zumbrota Shoe & Leather Repair"
  description="The story of Ansley Travo, owner of Zumbrota Shoe & Leather Repair. From sweeping floors at Luya Shoes to running her own bench."
>
  <section class="relative h-[70vh] overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/photos/ansley-shop-entrance.jpg"
      alt="Ansley Travo at her shop in Zumbrota"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 px-6 pb-16 text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-tan mb-4">About</p>
        <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl">Ansley Travo</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-snug text-ink mb-12 text-center">
        "Shoes are the 'roots' of your body."
      </p>

      <div class="prose-content font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft space-y-6">
        <p>
          My name is Ansley Bea Travo, owner of Zumbrota Shoe & Leather Repair.
        </p>
        <p>
          At the age of 15, eager to work I began working for Connie Hawley
          owner of Luya Shoes in Zumbrota. Little did I know, what started as
          just a job quickly became a foundational part of what brought me to
          where I am now. After several years at Luya I've learned shoes are
          the "roots" of your body as I tell my customers. Realizing the
          importance of how a good pair of footwear impacts our everyday life.
        </p>
        <p>
          My senior year of high school I would ask classmates if I could clean
          and shine their boots. After I graduated I began working with Mike
          Derouin of "Thee Only Shoe Repair" at this point Mike had retired and
          closed his business in Rochester. Despite this being a dwindling
          trade, I was very fortunate to have found Mike who was willing to
          give his knowledge, time, and patience. As time went on my bags of
          repair items got heavier and variety of jobs expanded.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 mb-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <figure>
        <img
          src="/photos/ansley-and-mike.jpg"
          alt="Ansley with her mentor Mike Derouin"
          class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover"
        />
        <figcaption class="text-center text-sm text-ink-soft italic mt-4">
          With Mike Derouin — mentor, teacher, and friend.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="prose-content font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft space-y-6">
        <p>
          Moving forward, I wanted my own shop, equipment and looking for a
          space became a priority. Through Mike's connections I was able to
          source the machinery I needed to become independent. And later found
          a space that fit my growing business.
        </p>
        <p>
          My goal is simple: to provide quality repairs, honest service, and
          workmanship you can trust. Whether it's a favorite pair of shoes or
          other special items. Repairs aren't just a "fix" — it's giving a new
          life to those items that you value.
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-2xl text-ink not-italic pt-4">
          I look forward to hearing your story and giving your beloved items a
          longer and stronger life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <img
        src="/photos/ansley-stitcher-bw.jpg"
        alt="Ansley at the stitching machine"
        class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover"
      />
      <img
        src="/photos/landis-machines.jpg"
        alt="Vintage Landis cobbling machines in the shop"
        class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-oxblood text-cream py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-6">Bring me your story.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-cream/85 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Every repair starts with a conversation. Tell me what you've got and
        what it means to you.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-7 py-3 bg-cream text-oxblood text-sm uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-paper transition-colors"
      >
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
